**Prerequisite:** Gravity sphere, CL 12+.

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Strength, Intelligence, or Wisdom score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

When you would be moved against your will, knocked Prone, or dropped from flight, you may use your Reaction and spend 2 CP or Stamina to anchor yourself.

Until the start of your next turn:

your Speed becomes 0;

you cannot be moved against your will by effects of Core Formation or lower;

you do not fall unless the surface supporting you is destroyed;

attacks against you have Advantage until the start of your next turn.

