**Prerequisite:** Music sphere, Formations sphere, CL 8+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Charisma, Wisdom, or Dexterity score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

When designing a Formation, ritual hall, bell tower, drum terrace, concert court, funeral rite, or morale project, use one Music principle you know as a seed concept.

Choose one principle from:

Measure;

Tone;

Chord;

Dissonance;

Echo Performer;

Battle Cadence;

Soul-Sound;

Silence-Breaking Note.

This does not create the project automatically.

The project still requires time, materials, site access, a power source whose Source CL is at least the project's Source CL, and maintenance.

