**Prerequisite:** Obsidian Glass Scripture or Cinderglass Shards, CL 10+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Constitution, Strength, or Intelligence score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

Once per turn when a hostile creature takes Slashing damage from your Obsidian Terrain or Cinderglass Shards, choose one:

• reduce its Speed by 10 feet until the start of your next turn;

• prevent Reactions until the start of your next turn;

• mark it with black-glass residue, preventing ordinary Invisible from benefiting it until the start of your next turn;

• add your Proficiency Bonus to the damage.

