**Prerequisite:** Blood Pump, CL16+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Constitution score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

**Source CL:** Body Refining Source CL unless a named Sphere or other Source Rule supplies the effect.

When Blood Pump successfully replaces a reduction to 0 Hit Points, choose one benefit after you are set to 1 Hit Point:

- move up to 10 feet without provoking Opportunity Attacks;
- end one ordinary Frightened condition affecting you;
- end one ordinary Grappled or Restrained condition affecting you;
- regain Stamina equal to your Proficiency Bonus, not above your maximum; or
- gain Temporary Hit Points equal to `2 × your Proficiency Bonus`.

An equal- or higher-Source-CL effect that explicitly prevents the chosen removal is not ended. Movement requires a legal destination.

