**Prerequisite:** Bloodline Cultivator, Ancestral Bloodline Awakening, or another active bloodline engine; CL12+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Constitution, Intelligence, or Charisma score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

When you activate a bloodline feature explicitly tagged **Surge**, **Transformation**, or **Release**, choose two different Fusion benefits:

- gain Temporary Hit Points equal to `2 × your Proficiency Bonus`;
- move 10 feet without provoking Opportunity Attacks;
- regain 2 Qi;
- gain Advantage on your next saving throw before the end of your next turn;
- end ordinary Frightened or Charmed when its Source CL is lower than yours;
- move your Domain Armament 20 feet; or
- your next lineage-tagged attack or technique before the end of your next turn deals additional damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus.

One bloodline activation triggers Bloodline-Core Fusion once.

