**Prerequisite:** Chains sphere, CL 8+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Strength, Dexterity, or Wisdom score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

You may move along your own chains as though they were stable ground.

You gain the following benefits:

climb at full Speed using chains;

swing across gaps without checks when a valid chain route exists;

use Chain Bridge once per scene without spending CP;

ignore ordinary falling damage if a valid anchor exists within 60 feet and you are not incapacitated.

