**Prerequisite:** Water sphere, Cleansing Water, CL 8+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Wisdom, Dexterity, or Constitution score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

When a creature benefits from your Cleansing Basin, choose one additional benefit:

it may immediately repeat a saving throw against Poisoned or disease;

it gains Advantage on its next death saving throw before the start of your next turn;

it removes one mundane contamination, smoke effect, or environmental grime.

