**Prerequisite:** Iron Fist sphere, Dragon-Step Clinch, CL 8+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

When you maintain a body clinch:

the target no longer has Advantage on checks to escape solely because the clinch is maintained without a hand;

you may use Rising Knee once per turn without requiring the target to already be Grappled by hand;

when the target misses you with a melee attack, reduce its Speed by 5 feet until the start of its next turn.

